Subject: [PATCH 09/18] Federation v2 tests and docs

In-process gRPC integration tests over mutual TLS (getIdentity/HealthCheck +
inbound SA routing + federated-EUD registration, and untrusted-CA rejection).
Skipped under gevent monkey-patching (grpc deadlocks on patched sockets; the
production federation_server does not monkey-patch) - covered live by
fed_live_test.py --v2. README and FEDERATION.md updated for v2.
